{
	title: "Coal and Black Lung, Second Revision Edition",
	icon: "minecraft:coal",
	x: -8.0d,
	y: 10.5d,
	description: "Inhale coal dust, exhale silicosis",
	text: [
		"Black Lung, or silicosis, is a disease added by Nuclear Tech Mod.",
		"",
		"Upon mining coal ore, Coal Dust is spawned, which will destroy your lung health. Holding coal, coal powder, or lignite powder in your inventory also damages your lungs.",
		"",
		"Prolonged inhalation of coal dust gives negative status effects such as Weakness and causes you to cough blood and soot at higher levels. ",
		"",
		"When you are exposed to a lung hazard, a pop up on the top right of your screen will tell you that its harder to breath, this indicates your lungs are being damaged by airborne particles.",
		"",
		"To counteract the lung damage, you can equip a Gas Mask with a filter that has the Airborne Particle trait to protect you from coal dust.",
		"",
		"Using SiOX Cancer Medication or Herbal Paste will partially heal the disease, from which it will heal in about an hour.",
		"",
		"To check the status of your lungs, you can use the Lung Diagnostic item, it will tell you how much asbestos or coal damage your lungs have taken.",
		"",
		"(This modpack has added a recipe for the Lung Diagnostic item)."
	],
